{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"AnimeAkashicRecords (AAR) Search & Retrieval Engine","description":"Industrial-Grade, Ultra-Low-Latency (~500ms) Neural Hybrid Search & Retrieval Engine over Anime, Manga, Light Novels, and Visual Novels.\n\n### Recommended Integration Profiles & Use Cases:\n- **Streaming Services & Media Catalogs:** Powers instant search-as-you-type and discovery across titles, obscure character traits, and vague plot descriptions in ~500ms.\n- **AI Chatbots & Conversational RAG:** Provides high-density context blocks with exact provenance, character synergy, and structured metadata to prevent hallucinations.\n- **Autonomous AI Agents:** Operates as a fast, deterministic tool with strict SQL scope filtering (years, formats, adult tags) and zero conversational bloat.\n\n### Query Breakdown & Performance Modes:\n- **Default Mode (`query_breakdown=false`):** Blazing-fast native hybrid retrieval fusing ScaNN-cascade dense vectors (int8 Qdrant), FTS5 BM25, and deep Cross-Encoder reranking without LLM overhead (~500ms).\n- **Optional LLM Breakdown (`query_breakdown=true`):** Pass `query_breakdown: true` to decompose complex, multi-part, or comparative queries via an LLM prior to vector retrieval.","version":"1.2.0"},"paths":{"/health":{"get":{"summary":"Health","operationId":"health_health_get","parameters":[{"name":"x-api-key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"X-Api-Key"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true,"title":"Response Health Health Get"}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/stats":{"get":{"summary":"Stats","description":"Public catalog statistics, media counts, and index health.\nExtended cluster and model configs are returned for verified admin keys.","operationId":"stats_sta